Package: com.mikey820.airpodsreconnectfix
Name: AirPodsReconnectFix
Version: 2.8.5
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: iOS 6 AirPods fix: pre-emptive service re-assert beats the ~45s firmware disconnect (SpringBoard), PLUS an in-app route-heal injected into the Music app that re-picks the AirPods output whenever media audio drifts off them after a skip/pause — never the speaker, so it can't strand audio
Maintainer: mikey820 <mikey820@users.noreply.github.com>
Author: mikey820
Section: Tweaks
Icon: icon.png
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), firmware (>= 6.0)
